# 统一按 LF 入库/检出。本机 core.autocrlf=true 时，git 会把文本文件检出成
# CRLF，而 prettier 默认 endOfLine=lf —— 结果就是 eslint 里成片的
# "Delete ␍" 警告（曾达 3200+ 条），把真正的问题埋在噪音里。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不能被当文本转换
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.pkg binary
*.AppImage binary

# Windows 侧脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
